ath\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eIf you want to report a security vulnerability, please follow the steps which we have defined for you in our \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/verdaccio/verdaccio/security/policy\"\u003esecurity policy\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003eSpecial Thanks\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-special-thanks\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Special Thanks\" href=\"#special-thanks\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eThanks to the following companies to help us to achieve our goals providing free open source licenses. Every company provides enough resources to move this project forward.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cmarkdown-accessiblity-table\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003cthead\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eCompany\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eLogo\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eLicense\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/thead\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eJetBrains\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://github.com/verdaccio/verdaccio/raw/master/assets/thanks/jetbrains/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"jetbrain\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eJetBrains provides licenses for products for active maintainers, renewable yearly\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCrowdin\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://crowdin.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://github.com/verdaccio/verdaccio/raw/master/assets/thanks/crowdin/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"crowdin\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCrowdin provides platform for translations\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBrowserStack\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.browserstack.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/cbaffe1d891728891766b53bfd8113002611c27da568f6d95a3570b389181bbc/68747470733a2f2f63646e2e76657264616363696f2e6465762f726561646d652f62726f77736572737461636b5f6c6f676f2e706e67\" alt=\"browserstack\" data-canonical-src=\"https://cdn.verdaccio.dev/readme/browserstack_logo.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eBrowserStack provides plan to run End to End testing for the UI\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAlgolia\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://algolia.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/b5f77ce1f80db5a838b46887b102a6d5fc751cc922b05e6f3bc902db62aee25a/68747470733a2f2f63646e2e76657264616363696f2e6465762f73706f6e736f722f6c6f676f2f616c676f6c69612f6c6f676f2e706e67\" alt=\"algolia\" data-canonical-src=\"https://cdn.verdaccio.dev/sponsor/logo/algolia/logo.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAlgolia provides search services for the website\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eDocker\u003c/td\